        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamo mwezi wa saba, Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, mjukuu wa Elishama, wa ukoo wa kifalme, mmoja wa maofisa wakuu wa mfalme, alifika Mizpa kwa Gedalia akiandamana na watu kumi. Wakati walipokuwa wanakula chakula huko Mizpa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania pamoja na wale watu kumi, wakainuka na kumshambulia kwa upanga Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, mjukuu wa Shafani, wakamuua. Gedalia ndiye aliyekuwa ameteuliwa na mfalme wa Babuloni kuwa mtawala wa nchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishmaeli aliwaua pia Wayahudi wote waliokuwa pamoja na Gedalia huko Mizpa na wanajeshi Wakaldayo waliokuwa mahali hapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja baada ya kumwua Gedalia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabla hata mtu yeyote hajajua habari hizo, walifika watu themanini kutoka Shekemu, Shilo na Samaria. Walikuwa wamenyoa ndevu zao na wamevaa mavazi yaliyotatuka na miili yao imechanjwachanjwa. Walileta tambiko za nafaka na ubani zitolewe hekaluni kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, alitoka nje ya mji kuwalaki watu hao huku analia. Alipokutana nao, akawaambia, “Karibuni nyumbani kwa Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipoingia mjini, Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, pamoja na wale watu kumi waliokuwa pamoja naye, waliwaua watu hao na kuzitupa maiti zao kisimani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini palikuwa na watu kumi katika kundi hilo waliomwambia Ishmaeli: “Tafadhali usituue, maana tuna akiba kubwa ya ngano, shayiri, mafuta na asali ambayo tumeificha mashambani.” Basi hao akawaacha hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisima ambamo Ishmaeli alitupa maiti za wale watu aliowaua kilikuwa ni kile kikubwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kilikuwa ni kile kikubwa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tafsiri moja ya zamani; Kiebrania kwa njia ya Gedalia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ambacho mfalme Asa alikuwa amekichimba ili kujihami dhidi ya Baasha, mfalme wa Waisraeli. Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, alikijaza kisima hicho maiti za wale watu aliowaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Ishmaeli aliwateka binti zake mfalme na watu wote waliosalia Mizpa, watu ambao Nebuzaradani, kapteni wa walinzi, alikuwa amemkabidhi Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu. Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, aliwachukua mateka hao, akaondoka, akaenda kwa Waamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Yohanani mwana wa Karea, pamoja na viongozi wote wa majeshi, waliposikia juu ya uovu ambao Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, alikuwa ameufanya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waliwakusanya watu wao wote, wakaenda kupigana na Ishmaeli. Walimkuta penye bwawa kuu lililoko Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote waliotekwa na Ishmaeli walipomwona Yohanani mwana wa Karea, pamoja na viongozi wote wa majeshi, walifurahi sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, watu hao wote ambao Ishmaeli alikuwa amewachukua mateka kutoka Mizpa, waligeuka, wakarudi nyuma, wakamwendea Yohanani mwana wa Karea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, pamoja na watu wanane waliponyoka kutoka kwa Yohanani, wakakimbilia kwa Waamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Yohanani mwana wa Karea pamoja na viongozi wote wa majeshi waliokuwa pamoja naye, waliwachukua watu wote waliosalia, ambao Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, alikuwa amewachukua mateka kutoka Mizpa baada ya kumwua Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, yaani: Askari, wanawake, watoto na matowashi. Yohanani aliwarudisha wote kutoka Gibeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
